    "techstack": "<h4>Frontend:</h4> Next.js 14 + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + Framer Motion.<br><h4>Backend:</h4> FastAPI (Python) + Celery for async tasks.<br><h4>Database:</h4> PostgreSQL + Redis cache + Pinecone vector store.<br><h4>Auth:</h4> Clerk with HIPAA-compliant session handling.<br><h4>AI:</h4> GPT-4o for reasoning + Med-PaLM 2 embeddings + Whisper for voice.<br><h4>Deploy:</h4> Vercel (frontend) + Railway (backend) + Cloudflare CDN.",
