    "overview": "<h3>🌍 Battery Storage Optimizer</h3><p>The global climate tech investment reached <b>$1.1 trillion in 2023</b>, with carbon markets, renewable energy, and ESG solutions leading the charge. This platform provides battery storage optimizer capabilities to help organizations navigate the transition to net zero. The climate crisis is the defining challenge of our time — and hackathon judges increasingly score on real-world environmental impact. The winning angle: show a live carbon calculation or ESG metric with real data, then demonstrate the AI's insight (reduction opportunity, risk score, or offset recommendation). Cite your environmental impact in CO₂ tonnes saved or energy kWh optimized.</p>",
