    "overview": "<h3>🤖 Document Intelligence Platform</h3><p>The AI tools market is projected to reach <b>$1.81 trillion by 2030</b>, growing at 37% CAGR as every developer and enterprise scrambles to build AI-native products. This platform provides document intelligence platform capabilities to dramatically accelerate AI development workflows. The winning angle at hackathons: your tool makes OTHER AI builders faster. Show it reducing prompt iteration from 30 minutes to 30 seconds, or cutting RAG evaluation from days to minutes. Judges building their own AI projects will immediately covet your tool. Supports GPT-4o, Claude 3.5, Gemini 1.5 Pro, and local Ollama models via unified API.</p>",
