    "overview": "<h3>🔗 Blockchain Voting System</h3><p>The global blockchain market is projected to reach <b>$1.4 trillion by 2030</b>. Web3 is rebuilding financial infrastructure, creative economies, and governance from the ground up. This platform delivers blockchain voting system capabilities on-chain, enabling trustless, permissionless interactions with full transparency and user ownership of data and assets. The winning angle: make it work with a real wallet in a real testnet transaction — judges at Web3 hackathons connect MetaMask instantly and test everything live. Support Ethereum mainnet + Polygon PoS + testnet demos. Show gas optimization (important!) and front-end responsiveness in the demo. Reference EIP standards and audit status for credibility.</p>",
