    "overview": "<h3>🎮 Game Economy Simulator</h3><p>The global gaming market generates <b>$184 billion annually</b>, overtaking both music and film combined. AI is transforming every layer — from AI-driven NPCs to adaptive difficulty and procedural content generation. This platform delivers game economy simulator capabilities, giving game developers superpowers to build smarter, more engaging experiences. The winning angle: show a live game interaction — an AI NPC responding dynamically, a generated level, or a real-time player analytics dashboard. Gaming judges are developers themselves; they appreciate technical depth, clean architecture, and features that would take months to build from scratch. Demo with a playable prototype whenever possible — it's the most memorable kind of presentation.</p>",
