    "mega_prompt": "You are a Principal BioTech Engineer. Build \"BioTech Pharmacokinetics Simulator\" using Next.js 14, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and GPT-4o. Requirements: (1) Secure multi-role auth via Clerk. (2) Core BioTech feature: pharmacokinetics simulator with real-time data processing. (3) RAG pipeline: ingest domain documents → embed → query GPT-4o for intelligent answers. (4) Analytics dashboard with Recharts showing key BioTech metrics. (5) AI assistant chat with BioTech-specific knowledge base. (6) Export reports as PDF with professional formatting. (7) Mobile-responsive dark/light mode UI with Framer Motion. Demo flow: Login → see main dashboard → interact with core feature → get AI insight → export report. Deploy on Vercel + Railway. Start with auth + database schema + core feature.",
    "database_schema": "Table users { id uuid [pk], email varchar, role varchar, org_id uuid, created_at timestamp }\nTable biotech_records { id uuid [pk], user_id uuid [ref: > users.id], title varchar, data jsonb, status varchar, created_at timestamp }\nTable ai_analyses { id uuid [pk], record_id uuid, input_text text, output_text text, model varchar, tokens_used int, created_at timestamp }\nTable embeddings { id uuid [pk], source_id uuid, content text, embedding vector(1536), metadata jsonb, created_at timestamp }\nTable analytics_events { id uuid [pk], user_id uuid, event_type varchar, payload jsonb, timestamp timestamp }",
    "api_endpoints": "- POST /api/v1/auth/register\n- POST /api/v1/auth/login\n- GET /api/v1/biotech/records\n- POST /api/v1/biotech/records\n- GET /api/v1/biotech/records/{id}\n- PUT /api/v1/biotech/records/{id}\n- POST /api/v1/ai/analyze\n- POST /api/v1/ai/chat\n- GET /api/v1/analytics/summary\n- GET /api/v1/analytics/trends\n- POST /api/v1/search/semantic\n- POST /api/v1/reports/generate\n- GET /api/v1/alerts\n- POST /api/v1/alerts/acknowledge\n- WS /ws/live-updates",
    "win_secret": "<b>Judge Psychology:</b> BioTech judges look for domain expertise AND technical execution. Show you understand the specific pain point, not just the technology.<br><b>Demo Hook (0-30s):</b> Trigger the most impressive AI feature immediately — real data, real AI response, real value. Don't spend time on login flows or setup during the demo itself.<br><b>Market Stat:</b> \"The BioTech market is worth $727 billion by 2025. Our solution targets a specific $X billion pain point within it.\"<br><b>Q&A Prep:</b> Know the top 3 competitors in BioTech space, the main regulatory frameworks, and your specific AI model's accuracy metrics.",
    "industry": "BioTech"
