    "win_secret": "<b>Judge Psychology:</b> DeepTech judges look for domain expertise AND technical execution. Show you understand the specific pain point, not just the technology.<br><b>Demo Hook (0-30s):</b> Trigger the most impressive AI feature immediately — real data, real AI response, real value. Don't spend time on login flows or setup during the demo itself.<br><b>Market Stat:</b> \"The DeepTech market is worth $700 billion by 2025. Our solution targets a specific $X billion pain point within it.\"<br><b>Q&A Prep:</b> Know the top 3 competitors in DeepTech space, the main regulatory frameworks, and your specific AI model's accuracy metrics.",
