  "result": {
    "overview": "<h3>🛒 Headless Commerce Builder</h3><p>The E-commerce market is valued at <b>$8.1 trillion by 2026</b>. This platform delivers headless commerce builder capabilities using cutting-edge AI and modern cloud-native architecture. The winning hackathon angle: show a live, working feature that solves a real problem in the first 30 seconds. Judges in E-commerce tracks value technical depth, real-world applicability, and measurable impact. Built with production-ready security, scalable infrastructure, and AI-first design principles. Integrates with leading E-commerce APIs and data sources for maximum demo impact. Show specific metrics: time saved, cost reduced, accuracy improved, or lives impacted. The AI strategy uses RAG + GPT-4o for intelligent responses with domain-specific context.</p>",
    "techstack": "<h4>Frontend:</h4> Next.js 14 + Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Stripe Elements.<br><h4>Backend:</h4> Node.js + BullMQ + Stripe/Shopify APIs.<br><h4>Database:</h4> PostgreSQL + Redis + Pinecone.<br><h4>AI:</h4> GPT-4o + CLIP (visual search) + Collaborative Filtering.<br><h4>Deploy:</h4> Vercel + Railway.",
    "ai_strategy": "1. <b>Domain Data Ingestion:</b> Structured + unstructured E-commerce data → normalized → stored with embeddings.<br>2. <b>RAG Pipeline:</b> Domain knowledge base → text-embedding-3-large → Pinecone → GPT-4o with E-commerce-specific system prompt.<br>3. <b>Predictive ML:</b> XGBoost/RandomForest on structured domain data → key risk/opportunity prediction with confidence scores.<br>4. <b>Computer Vision:</b> YOLOv8/SAM → domain-specific image analysis → structured output with action recommendations.<br>5. <b>Anomaly Detection:</b> Isolation Forest on time-series data → alerts for critical deviations with root cause analysis.<br>6. <b>Offline Fallback:</b> Pre-cached domain knowledge + local rule engine for reliable demo without API connectivity.",
    "mega_prompt": "You are a Principal E-commerce Engineer. Build \"E-commerce Headless Commerce Builder\" using Next.js 14, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and GPT-4o. Requirements: (1) Secure multi-role auth via Clerk. (2) Core E-commerce feature: headless commerce builder with real-time data processing. (3) RAG pipeline: ingest domain documents → embed → query GPT-4o for intelligent answers. (4) Analytics dashboard with Recharts showing key E-commerce metrics. (5) AI assistant chat with E-commerce-specific knowledge base. (6) Export reports as PDF with professional formatting. (7) Mobile-responsive dark/light mode UI with Framer Motion. Demo flow: Login → see main dashboard → interact with core feature → get AI insight → export report. Deploy on Vercel + Railway. Start with auth + database schema + core feature.",
    "database_schema": "Table users { id uuid [pk], email varchar, role varchar, org_id uuid, created_at timestamp }\nTable e-commerce_records { id uuid [pk], user_id uuid [ref: > users.id], title varchar, data jsonb, status varchar, created_at timestamp }\nTable ai_analyses { id uuid [pk], record_id uuid, input_text text, output_text text, model varchar, tokens_used int, created_at timestamp }\nTable embeddings { id uuid [pk], source_id uuid, content text, embedding vector(1536), metadata jsonb, created_at timestamp }\nTable analytics_events { id uuid [pk], user_id uuid, event_type varchar, payload jsonb, timestamp timestamp }",
    "api_endpoints": "- POST /api/v1/auth/register\n- POST /api/v1/auth/login\n- GET /api/v1/e-commerce/records\n- POST /api/v1/e-commerce/records\n- GET /api/v1/e-commerce/records/{id}\n- PUT /api/v1/e-commerce/records/{id}\n- POST /api/v1/ai/analyze\n- POST /api/v1/ai/chat\n- GET /api/v1/analytics/summary\n- GET /api/v1/analytics/trends\n- POST /api/v1/search/semantic\n- POST /api/v1/reports/generate\n- GET /api/v1/alerts\n- POST /api/v1/alerts/acknowledge\n- WS /ws/live-updates",
    "win_secret": "<b>Judge Psychology:</b> E-commerce judges look for domain expertise AND technical execution. Show you understand the specific pain point, not just the technology.<br><b>Demo Hook (0-30s):</b> Trigger the most impressive AI feature immediately — real data, real AI response, real value. Don't spend time on login flows or setup during the demo itself.<br><b>Market Stat:</b> \"The E-commerce market is worth $8.1 trillion by 2026. Our solution targets a specific $X billion pain point within it.\"<br><b>Q&A Prep:</b> Know the top 3 competitors in E-commerce space, the main regulatory frameworks, and your specific AI model's accuracy metrics.",
    "industry": "E-commerce"
  },
